<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Feb 12.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Feb 12.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement at the close of trade on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at the close was 3483.48, 18.79 points or 0.54 percent lower than Tuesday's close.</p>
